            "review_title": "Review at Mon Ngon Hue",
            "review_text": "Tanfamily2022\nHong Kong, China10 contributions\n0\nBest Bun Bo Hue in Hanoi!\nDec 2022 • Family\nThe restaurant is small but clean and family friendly. The Bun Bo Hue is very tasty, full of lemongrass flavour. They also serve other traditional and tasty Vietnamese dishes: banh kroai, banh beo, nem lui. Our 4 kids (9, 11, 13 and 16 years old) love the banh beo and banh kroai. Will definitely return!\nWritten January 3, 2023",
